sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Auth as JwtBearer / Authorization
    participant Service as Application Service
    Client->>API: Request + Bearer token
    API->>Auth: Validate signature / issuer / audience / lifetime
    Auth-->>API: ClaimsPrincipal
    API->>API: Role / ownership checks
    API->>Service: Execute authorized use case
    Service-->>API: Result
    API-->>Client: HTTP response
